~ fishing_village_residents_ch2_start
Fishing Village Residents: We rely on the sea every day, but now we catch less fish and see more trash near the shore.
Player: Let’s clean up the garbage together and make the beach beautiful! Protect the environment, start with small things.
Villagers: Okay! Come on, everyone!
Player: Put plastics here, recyclables there. Sorting is more environmentally friendly! Correct sorting can reduce pollution and protect marine life.
do QuestState.mark_chapter2_quest2_residents_done()
=> END

~ arden_steven_villagers_ch2_start
Player: Let’s set three ocean protection agreements together, okay?
Player: 1) Clean the beach regularly. 2) Don’t catch small fish; use ocean-friendly nets. 3) Pilot ecological fish farming.
Matt: Okay! I will abide by it!
Kai: I will abide by it too!
Villagers: We will protect the sea together!
do QuestState.mark_chapter2_quest4_meeting_done()
=> END

