~ arden_steven_villagers_ch3_dialogue_start
Player: Everyone’s ideas are great! Let’s hold a multicultural harvest festival! Every culture is precious and worthy of respect.
Player: Keep the traditional rituals of each family and take turns to display; set up a food area for everyone to share delicious food; build a stage together, harmony without uniformity, okay?
Villagers: Great! We all agree!
do QuestState.mark_chapter3_quest3_festival_setup_done()
=> END

